@startuml Lihat_Laporan_Admin
!theme plain
title Sequence Diagram: Lihat Laporan (View Report) - Admin
actor Admin
participant "Mobile App\n(Flutter)" as App
participant "Backend\nAPI" as API
database "Database" as DB

Admin -> App: Login sebagai Admin
App -> App: Set Admin Session
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Admin Dashboard

Admin -> App: Klik Menu Laporan/Report
App --> Admin: Tampilkan Report Options\n(Sales, Inventory, Customer, Transaction)

alt Sales Report
    Admin -> App: Pilih Sales Report
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Date Range Picker

    Admin -> App: Input Tanggal Awal & Akhir (atau Predefined: Today/This Week/This Month)
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/sales?date_from={date}&date_to={date}
    API -> DB: Query Orders dan Items dalam Date Range
    DB --> API: Return Sales Data

    API -> API: Calculate:\n- Total Revenue\n- Total Orders\n- Avg Order Value\n- Top Products\n- Payment Methods Distribution
    API --> App: Response Sales Report

    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Sales Report\n(Total Revenue, Total Orders, Avg Order Value, Chart)

    alt Export Report
        Admin -> App: Klik Export (PDF/Excel)
        App -> API: POST /api/admin/reports/sales/export
        API -> DB: Query Report Data (Same as above)
        DB --> API: Return Data
        API -> API: Generate PDF/Excel File
        API --> App: Return File URL
        App --> Admin: Download Report File

else Inventory Report
    Admin -> App: Pilih Inventory Report
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/inventory
    API -> DB: Query All Products dengan Stock Levels
    DB --> API: Return Inventory Data

    API -> API: Calculate:\n- Total Products\n- Low Stock Items (<Min Threshold)\n- Out of Stock Items\n- Total Inventory Value
    API --> App: Response Inventory Report

    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Inventory Report\n(Product Name, Current Stock, Min Stock, Status)

    alt Filter by Status
        Admin -> App: Filter Low Stock / Out of Stock
        App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/inventory?filter={status}
        API -> DB: Query Filtered Inventory
        DB --> API: Return Filtered Data
        API --> App: Response Filtered Inventory
        App --> Admin: Refresh Report dengan Filter

else Customer Report
    Admin -> App: Pilih Customer Report
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Filter Options (Tanggal, Segment)

    Admin -> App: Input Date Range & Segmentation
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/customers?date_from={date}&date_to={date}
    API -> DB: Query Customer Data & Orders
    DB --> API: Return Customer Data

    API -> API: Calculate:\n- Total Customers (New vs Returning)\n- Customer Lifetime Value\n- Purchase Frequency\n- Top Customers\n- Customer Retention Rate
    API --> App: Response Customer Report

    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Customer Report\n(Total Customers, New Customers, Repeat Customers, Top Spenders)

else Transaction Report (Detailed)
    Admin -> App: Pilih Transaction Report
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Date Range Picker

    Admin -> App: Input Tanggal & Filter (Status, Payment Method)
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/transactions?date_from={date}&date_to={date}&status={status}&payment_method={method}
    API -> DB: Query All Transactions
    DB --> API: Return Transaction List

    API -> API: Calculate:\n- Total Transactions\n- Failed Transactions\n- Pending Transactions\n- Completed Transactions\n- Total Amount by Payment Method
    API --> App: Response Transaction Report

    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Transaction Report Detail\n(Transaction ID, Amount, Status, Payment Method, Date)

    alt View Transaction Detail
        Admin -> App: Klik Salah Satu Transaction
        App -> API: GET /api/admin/reports/transactions/{transaction_id}
        API -> DB: Query Transaction Detail
        DB --> API: Return Detailed Data
        API --> App: Response Detail
        App --> Admin: Tampilkan Full Transaction Information\n(Order Details, Customer, Payment Status, Timeline)
end

alt View Analytics Dashboard
    Admin -> App: Klik Tab Analytics/Dashboard
    App -> API: GET /api/admin/analytics/dashboard
    API -> DB: Query Multiple Data:\n- Today Sales\n- Weekly Trend\n- Top Products\n- Recent Orders\n- Pending Tasks
    DB --> API: Return All Analytics Data

    API --> App: Response Dashboard Data
    App --> Admin: Tampilkan Analytics Dashboard\n(KPI Cards, Sales Chart, Top Products Chart, Recent Activity)

end

@enduml
